WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
A clear draft. Ready for your review. Open EOD Review, draft from the record, then make it yours.

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:05.117
Open EOD Review. Start in My Day, then choose EOD Review in the sidebar.

00:00:05.117 --> 00:00:07.583
Draft from the record. Choose Draft with AI to build a version of your report.

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:12.083
Read the report. Check the summary, completed work, and anything carried forward.

00:00:12.083 --> 00:00:16.167
Need a correction? Open Raw. Edit the words directly before you submit.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:20.083
Check the final preview. Return to Preview to read what your manager will receive.

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:22.983
Submit only when it is accurate. Submit EOD sends the report. This walkthrough leaves the draft unsubmitted.

00:00:22.983 --> 00:00:25.283
Review it. Then submit. Nothing is filed until you choose Submit EOD. This demo stops at the draft.
